  {'t': 'p', 'text': 'Also ask whether your state licenses mold work and whether the company or its crew holds whatever is required. Rules differ by state, so confirm with the state agency rather than relying on a verbal answer.'},
  {'t': 'h2', 'text': 'Comparing quotes fairly'},
