  {'t': 'p', 'text': 'Prices vary with the size of the affected area, the materials involved, how much containment is needed and how long drying takes. Be careful with a quote that gives a number before anyone has seen the space, since the scope is not known yet.'},
  {'t': 'h2', 'text': 'Clearance testing for a sale or a loan'},
  {'t': 'p', 'text': 'Some buyers and lenders ask for proof that mold was addressed. That usually means independent clearance testing done by a third party who did not perform the removal. Having a separate tester avoids any appearance of grading your own work.'},
